  "homeSleepInsightInfoPredictTitle": "Next sleep",
  "homeSleepInsightInfoPredictBody": "It starts from the last wake (end of a nap or night sleep) and adds a wake window based on age and recent history. The time range reflects that variability.\n\nIf a sleep is in progress, you’ll see “Sleeping...” instead of a prediction.",
